# Royal Mix — Corporate Overview

Royal Mix is a unified digital ecosystem combining:
- Food Delivery
- Health Services
- Supplier Network
- Delivery & Logistics
- Publicity System
- AI Modules
- Rewards Program
- National compliance (Zambia-first launch)

## Features
- Multi-language support
- Supplier verification (Coca-Cola, Pepsi, Local Markets, Royal Mix Production)
- Publicity system (mandatory 1-month pre-launch announcement)
- Delivery tracking system
- Unified app architecture for Food + Health + Delivery + Supplier
- Testnet ready for rapid deployment

## Expansion
- Lusaka → Copperbelt → Zambia → Africa → Global
